<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; font-size:
      .9em; line-height: 30px; } .header { text-align: center; background-color:
      #4CAF50; padding: 10px; color: white; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
      .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #fff; border-radius: 0 0 8px
      8px; } .content p { margin: 10px 0; } .footer { text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; } .semi-bold {
      font-weight: bold; } .text-base { font-size: 14px; } .margin-base {
      margin: 20px 0; line-height: normal; }

    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="semi-bold">Dear {{client}},</div>
      <div style="line-height: normal;">Following the verification of your
        payment, please find attached the Payment Receipt of [Invoice Number]
        for your records.
      </div>

      <div class="margin-base">
        <div class="semi-bold" style="margin-bottom: 7px;">Invoice Details</div>
        <table class="text-base" style="margin-left: -3px;">
          <tr>
            <td align="left" valign="top">Invoice Number</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">:</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">{{invoiceNumber}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" valign="top">Date of Issue</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">:</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">{{issueDate}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" valign="top">Amount Paid</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">:</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">{{amount}}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" valign="top">Payment Verified On</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">:</td>
            <td align="left" valign="top">{{paidAt}}</td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="margin-base">
        This invoice serves as the official confirmation of your completed
        transaction. Please retain it for your accounting and audit purposes.
      </div>

      <div class="margin-base">
        We sincerely thank you for your timely payment and for your continued
        trust in AXIA Group. We look forward to supporting you in our ongoing
        collaboration.
      </div>

      <div class="margin-base">
        Should you require any additional documentation or assistance, please
        feel free to contact us at
        {{email}}.
      </div>

      <hr style="width: 35px; margin: 50px 0 10px;" />

      <div>
        <div>Best regards,</div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: -10px;">AXIA Group</div>
        <div>Accounting Department</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>